<title>USA: Willbros names Bracken president/coo.</title>
<headline>Willbros names Bracken president/coo.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Willbros Group Inc said Monday it named Gary Bracken president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Bracken has been president of Willbros Engineering &amp; Construction Ltd since 1992.</p>
<p>Larry Bump, former president and COO, will remain chairman and chief executive officer, the company said.</p>
